{"version":1,"content":"<p>現如今，收寄快遞已經成為了許多人的日常。收寄快遞方便，但也難免會遇到讓人煩心的問題。你可能想不到，一個看似平常的操作：臨時改個上門時間，或者打客服電話諮詢一下包裹去向，在部分快遞公司的後台系統裏，卻可能被記錄成「投訴工單」，進而影響對快遞員的考核，甚至升級成罰款的操作。</p> <a href=\"https://www.cnbeta.com.tw/articles/tech/1583914.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>閲讀全文</strong></a>","scraped_at":"2026-10-26T08:41:12.519539+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":140,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-26T08:20:51+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-26T08:38:05.789138+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-26T08:38:05.789138+00:00","content_hash":"ea3179afb7eab7ae5cdd6adb0cd16c82a1b6e2e29099a67c2ac08ebd25c78980","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}